1
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:45,410
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:46,820
[Episode 23]

3
00:00:46,850 --> 00:00:47,250
[Adapted from Migu's novel
“Unsoiled Starlight” ]

4
00:00:47,270 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Writer: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:00:52,710 --> 00:00:54,050
Want me to give you a ride?

6
00:00:54,050 --> 00:00:54,840
No need.

7
00:00:55,190 --> 00:00:56,900
I'm going to Yunteng Technology
for outside business today.

8
00:00:56,900 --> 00:00:58,630
The car I called is downstairs.

9
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:00,290
This is an independent project

10
00:01:00,290 --> 00:01:01,720
I fought hard to get.

11
00:01:03,780 --> 00:01:04,379
Good luck.

12
00:01:04,780 --> 00:01:06,510
I'll pick you up when it's over.

13
00:01:21,730 --> 00:01:22,570
You know,

14
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:24,280
we've been working on this
home robot project

15
00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:25,560
for 5 years.

16
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:27,010
It's like our own child.

17
00:01:27,050 --> 00:01:28,740
If the funding chain hadn't broken,

18
00:01:28,740 --> 00:01:31,060
I wouldn't bear to transfer it
to someone else.

19
00:01:31,060 --> 00:01:31,640
Look—

20
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,600
this kind of

21
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:34,100
high-end smart technology,

22
00:01:34,100 --> 00:01:36,300
its prospects are obvious to everyone.

23
00:01:36,520 --> 00:01:37,250
Understood.

24
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:39,580
We'll conduct a comprehensive evaluation
of the project.

25
00:01:39,580 --> 00:01:41,979
We'll need Mr. Du's full cooperation then.

26
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:45,080
We've already reached a consensus

27
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:46,180
with Mr. Gao of Lisen Home.

28
00:01:46,180 --> 00:01:48,080
We're asking you to do
the legal assessment

29
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:49,210
just as a formality.

30
00:01:49,220 --> 00:01:50,550
No need to be so serious.

31
00:01:51,310 --> 00:01:53,240
Procedures are necessary
and indispensable.

32
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:54,700
We'll verify truthfully.

33
00:01:55,009 --> 00:01:56,210
Please rest assured.

34
00:02:22,610 --> 00:02:23,540
It recharges me.

35
00:02:24,920 --> 00:02:25,600
What?

36
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:27,470
Are they hard to deal with?

37
00:02:27,470 --> 00:02:29,530
Clients are always hard to deal with.

38
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,120
Not really.

39
00:02:32,890 --> 00:02:34,800
I'm pretty easy to deal with.

40
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:37,000
True.

41
00:02:37,190 --> 00:02:38,600
Known in the industry for
being hard to deal with—

42
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:39,829
the boss of Zhuoyuan Tech—

43
00:02:39,829 --> 00:02:40,829
was handled by me.

44
00:02:41,470 --> 00:02:42,670
I even admire myself.

45
00:02:44,270 --> 00:02:44,880
Then—

46
00:02:45,750 --> 00:02:46,640
reward me.

47
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:49,840
Drive.

48
00:03:02,660 --> 00:03:03,360
[Yunteng Tech Legal Assessment Report]

49
00:03:30,660 --> 00:03:31,220
Mr. Du.

50
00:03:31,250 --> 00:03:32,530
You sit. I have things to do.

51
00:03:32,530 --> 00:03:33,480
Go ahead.

52
00:03:52,030 --> 00:03:52,910
Sis, I'm taking it.

53
00:03:52,910 --> 00:03:53,400
Okay.

54
00:03:53,290 --> 00:03:55,170
[Yunteng Tech Legal Assessment Report]

55
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:17,800
Hello.

56
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:19,600
Hello.

57
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,380
What business are you here for?

58
00:04:21,380 --> 00:04:21,760
Yes.

59
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:24,000
Is the main hall closed now?

60
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:24,480
Yes.

61
00:04:24,650 --> 00:04:26,160
The property rights center
is under renovation.

62
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:26,760
Go out and turn right.

63
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:27,810
There's a temporary counter .

64
00:04:27,810 --> 00:04:28,200
Okay.

65
00:04:28,230 --> 00:04:29,630
-Thank you.
-No problem.

66
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:34,250
Here.

67
00:04:34,280 --> 00:04:35,159
Thanks.

68
00:04:36,380 --> 00:04:37,159
Hello.

69
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:38,730
The security guard inside said

70
00:04:38,730 --> 00:04:40,250
this temporary counter
can handle business.

71
00:04:40,250 --> 00:04:40,650
Right?

72
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:41,400
Yes.

73
00:04:41,580 --> 00:04:42,880
Our center is under renovation.

74
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:43,920
We're very sorry.

75
00:04:43,940 --> 00:04:45,640
What project do you want to check?

76
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:47,920
This is an authorization letter
from Yunteng Tech.

77
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:48,920
I'd like to check

78
00:04:48,940 --> 00:04:51,190
the company's intellectual
property registration.

79
00:04:51,190 --> 00:04:51,600
Okay.

80
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:52,730
One moment, please.

81
00:05:05,850 --> 00:05:06,310
[Senzhou Municipal Intellectual
Property Bureau]

82
00:05:06,310 --> 00:05:06,770
[Intellectual Property
Registration Certificate]

83
00:05:07,960 --> 00:05:08,560
Thank you.

84
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:09,610
You're welcome.

85
00:05:56,830 --> 00:06:00,040
[Hongzheng Law Firm]
[Xiao Junhua]

86
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:02,130
How's the progress on Yunteng's side?

87
00:06:03,450 --> 00:06:04,910
Mr. Du isn't very cooperative.

88
00:06:04,910 --> 00:06:05,880
But for now,

89
00:06:05,900 --> 00:06:07,820
the procedures and materials are complete.

90
00:06:07,820 --> 00:06:09,680
There shouldn't be any problems.

91
00:06:13,940 --> 00:06:14,920
Well done.

92
00:06:21,100 --> 00:06:24,590
[Attorney Shu Tinglan]

93
00:06:30,770 --> 00:06:32,150
[Yunteng Technology] [Risam furniture]

94
00:06:32,180 --> 00:06:34,880
[Family robot patent transfer ceremony]

95
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,060
[1. List of Technical Materials Handover]
[2. Acceptance Confirmation Form]

96
00:06:39,980 --> 00:06:40,960
here's to working together.

97
00:06:40,960 --> 00:06:42,560
Here's to working together.

98
00:06:45,820 --> 00:06:46,320
[Yunteng Technology] [Lisen Home]

99
00:06:46,340 --> 00:06:46,930
[Patent Transfer Ceremony
for Household Robot Technology]

100
00:06:53,820 --> 00:06:54,550
Lawyer Xiao.

101
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:55,909
So is this case

102
00:06:55,930 --> 00:06:57,060
considered closed?

103
00:06:57,409 --> 00:07:00,000
It's only officially closed
after payment is made.

104
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,280
But it should be soon.

105
00:07:01,300 --> 00:07:02,380
About a week.

106
00:07:02,410 --> 00:07:04,080
Lisen will pay Yunteng.

107
00:07:04,450 --> 00:07:05,600
We just need to wait.

108
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:09,080
Let's go eat.

109
00:07:14,260 --> 00:07:14,780
No.

110
00:07:15,530 --> 00:07:16,230
Looks like today

111
00:07:16,230 --> 00:07:17,560
I need to get home early.

112
00:07:17,620 --> 00:07:18,100
Okay.

113
00:07:18,440 --> 00:07:19,280
Go.

114
00:07:29,900 --> 00:07:32,650
[One week later]

115
00:07:37,750 --> 00:07:38,250
Good morning.

116
00:07:38,250 --> 00:07:38,920
Morning.

117
00:07:54,220 --> 00:07:55,240
Tinglan.

118
00:07:55,740 --> 00:07:57,600
Something's happened with
the Yunteng project.

119
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:59,290
The technical patent contract
for Lisen's acquisition

120
00:07:59,290 --> 00:08:00,120
has a problem.

121
00:08:00,300 --> 00:08:01,280
What did you say?

122
00:08:01,950 --> 00:08:02,750
That contract

123
00:08:03,080 --> 00:08:04,880
has no legal effect whatsoever.

124
00:08:08,430 --> 00:08:09,520
Tinglan.

125
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:26,920
Such a huge problem,

126
00:08:27,140 --> 00:08:29,150
causing the client to lose over 2 million,

127
00:08:29,150 --> 00:08:30,240
and damaging the firm's reputation—

128
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:32,169
this is your failure, Xiao Junhua.

129
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,360
By the end of today,

130
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:34,820
you must give me an answer.

131
00:08:35,260 --> 00:08:36,799
Okay, Mr. Zhao.

132
00:08:37,039 --> 00:08:38,700
If this problem isn't solved,

133
00:08:39,110 --> 00:08:40,240
I resign.

134
00:08:45,990 --> 00:08:47,120
Where are you going?

135
00:08:48,570 --> 00:08:49,560
To Yunteng.

136
00:08:50,180 --> 00:08:51,240
If you go now,

137
00:08:51,260 --> 00:08:52,320
what can you find?

138
00:08:53,870 --> 00:08:54,670
This project—

139
00:08:55,710 --> 00:08:57,540
I failed to check it properly for you.

140
00:08:57,540 --> 00:09:00,000
I also have an inescapable responsibility.

141
00:09:00,430 --> 00:09:01,290
No matter what,

142
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:03,080
this is the project I led.

143
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:05,570
I must see it through to the end.

144
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:13,280
Excuse me,

145
00:09:13,460 --> 00:09:14,910
could you go a bit faster?

146
00:09:14,940 --> 00:09:15,880
Okay.

147
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:18,870
[Zhuo Yu'an]

148
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,120
Hello?

149
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:23,360
Working overtime today?

150
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:24,400
Yea.

151
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:26,060
Something came up at the firm.

152
00:09:26,060 --> 00:09:27,280
I'll be home late.

153
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,940
Want me to come pick you up?

154
00:09:29,160 --> 00:09:30,080
No need.

155
00:09:31,250 --> 00:09:32,000
Then you—

156
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:33,340
be safe on the road.

157
00:09:33,890 --> 00:09:35,230
Let me know when you arrive.

158
00:09:35,230 --> 00:09:35,900
Okay.

159
00:09:52,040 --> 00:09:52,870
Secretary Wang.

160
00:09:52,870 --> 00:09:53,880
Where's Mr. Du?

161
00:09:53,900 --> 00:09:55,000
Lawyer Shu.

162
00:09:55,150 --> 00:09:56,640
Mr. Du resigned.

163
00:09:56,750 --> 00:09:57,760
Resigned?

164
00:09:58,170 --> 00:09:59,980
Isn't he Yunteng's second-
largest shareholder?

165
00:09:59,980 --> 00:10:01,110
How could he resign?

166
00:10:02,910 --> 00:10:04,800
Mr. Du absconded with the funds.

167
00:10:04,890 --> 00:10:05,840
You mean—

168
00:10:05,970 --> 00:10:07,930
the patent transfer fee?

169
00:10:07,950 --> 00:10:08,520
Yes.

170
00:10:08,610 --> 00:10:10,250
I heard he used his position

171
00:10:10,280 --> 00:10:11,390
to sell patents that weren't his

172
00:10:11,390 --> 00:10:12,540
to the acquiring party.

173
00:10:12,540 --> 00:10:13,550
Now that it's exposed,

174
00:10:13,550 --> 00:10:14,290
he's taken the money and run.

175
00:10:14,290 --> 00:10:14,860
I've got something on.

176
00:10:14,860 --> 00:10:15,400
Gotta go.

177
00:10:15,400 --> 00:10:16,330
Secretary Wang—

178
00:10:27,430 --> 00:10:28,440
Sorry.

179
00:10:28,460 --> 00:10:30,790
The number you have dialed is powered off.

180
00:10:34,700 --> 00:10:35,640
Sorry.

181
00:10:35,660 --> 00:10:37,990
The number you have dialed is powered off.

182
00:10:52,420 --> 00:10:53,560
You're back.

183
00:11:01,650 --> 00:11:03,080
I was worried about you.

184
00:11:04,280 --> 00:11:06,000
I'm fine.

185
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:07,840
I'm here.

186
00:11:19,780 --> 00:11:21,440
Am I useless?

187
00:11:42,380 --> 00:11:43,440
Careful, it's hot.

188
00:11:45,090 --> 00:11:47,000
I've carefully reviewed all the materials.

189
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:48,230
There are no problems.

190
00:11:48,230 --> 00:11:50,380
When you obtained the
certification documents,

191
00:11:50,380 --> 00:11:51,980
was there anything unusual?

192
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:58,090
Although Du Yunteng
wasn't very cooperative,

193
00:11:58,090 --> 00:11:59,100
he gave me all the materials

194
00:11:59,100 --> 00:12:00,320
he was supposed to.

195
00:12:04,230 --> 00:12:04,920
Could it be

196
00:12:06,060 --> 00:12:07,860
that the authorization letter?

197
00:12:08,060 --> 00:12:09,280
What's wrong with it?

198
00:12:09,830 --> 00:12:11,040
I just remembered—

199
00:12:11,270 --> 00:12:13,860
that day, when I mentioned
intellectual property ownership,

200
00:12:13,860 --> 00:12:15,320
he got a bit emotional.

201
00:12:15,650 --> 00:12:17,700
We've already reached a consensus

202
00:12:17,730 --> 00:12:18,920
with Mr. Gao of Lisen Home.

203
00:12:18,920 --> 00:12:20,540
We're asking you to do
the legal assessment

204
00:12:20,540 --> 00:12:21,800
just as a formality.

205
00:12:21,820 --> 00:12:23,150
No need to be so serious.

206
00:12:25,020 --> 00:12:25,880
Could it be

207
00:12:26,830 --> 00:12:28,890
that the property rights aren't his?

208
00:12:29,080 --> 00:12:31,300
Later, when I went to the property
rights center to verify,

209
00:12:31,300 --> 00:12:32,540
the first time, I couldn't find it.

210
00:12:32,540 --> 00:12:33,460
The second time,

211
00:12:33,460 --> 00:12:34,900
they said it was under renovation.

212
00:12:34,900 --> 00:12:36,400
A security guard told me

213
00:12:36,430 --> 00:12:39,690
there was a temporary counter
that could handle business.

214
00:12:40,230 --> 00:12:41,580
This property rights certificate

215
00:12:41,580 --> 00:12:43,610
was printed at the temporary window
on the second floor.

216
00:12:42,040 --> 00:12:42,950
[Senzhou Municipal Intellectual
Property Bureau]

217
00:12:42,950 --> 00:12:43,870
[Intellectual Property
Registration Certificate]

218
00:12:43,650 --> 00:12:44,560
Hello.

219
00:12:44,590 --> 00:12:46,120
What business are you here for?

220
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:47,500
The property rights center
is under renovation.

221
00:12:47,500 --> 00:12:49,000
Go out and turn right. There's a
temporary window.

222
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:49,540
Okay.

223
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:50,200
Thank you.

224
00:12:50,220 --> 00:12:50,880
No problem.

225
00:12:58,960 --> 00:12:59,920
Renovation.

226
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:01,880
Temporary counter.

227
00:13:05,590 --> 00:13:07,280
The window was fake.
